  "additionalOfficialText": {
    "surfboard-install": "Title: Installation | Surfboard Manual\n\nURL Source: https://getsurfboard.com/docs/installation\n\nMarkdown Content:\n*   Apps distributed by APKPure and Telegram channels are generally the same.\n\n*   Apps distributed by APKPure are generally relatively stable, but update less frequently.\n\n*   Telegram channels are updated more frequently, but there may be unknown issues.\n\nGenerally speaking, stable versions verified by telegram channels are regularly released to APKPure.\n\nYou can choose the installation and update channel according to your actual needs.\n",
    "surfboard-official": "Title: Surfboard Manual\n\nURL Source: https://getsurfboard.com/\n\nMarkdown Content:\nA network traffic processing tools on Android platform\n\n![Image 1](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/dashboard-242a0d7e46c30bbf027d7e07292f29c5.png)\n\n### Beautiful dashboard UI\n\n![Image 2](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/profiles-ca5d22598374915383b2f44475328b54.png)\n\n### Profiles management\n\n![Image 3](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/editor-6ed1902455561d89f908ca985652325d.png)\n\n### Embeded editor\n\n![Image 4](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/tools-3b26c77c0a42ad41dadd62a9b24ae50d.png)\n\n### Tools for debug\n\n![Image 5](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/dark_mode-9b8f75487b18e8b8066c8bc876130022.png)\n\n### Dark mode support\n\n![Image 6](https://getsurfboard.com/assets/images/settings-31f4c4bbc851e8e74450a6d51ea021fc.png)\n\n### More to explore...\n"
